# Cloud sync (Menu → Cloud Sync). Copy to `.env.local` for `npm run dev`, or set
# the same two as GitHub secrets SUPABASE_URL / SUPABASE_ANON_KEY for the APK.
#
# Both are PUBLIC values — the project URL and the ANON key are what every
# Supabase client app ships with, and the row-level security in
# `supabase/schema.sql` is what keeps one account's saves away from another's.
# Never put a service_role key here: it bypasses every policy, and anything in
# a Vite `VITE_*` variable is compiled into the app for anyone to read.
#
# Leave both unset and the app builds fine — sync then waits for the player to
# paste their own project on the Cloud Sync screen.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJ...
